{{!-- Context flattener.

Ghost's {{#get}} helper compiles its `filter` string against the CURRENT
context only — `../` paths do not resolve inside it. So when a filter needs
values from two different frames (the group tag being iterated AND the parent
post held one frame up), pass both in as hash params to this partial and
they arrive in a single frame:

    {{#> "with-this" groupTag=. indexPage=../indexPage}}
        {{#get "posts" filter="tags:{{indexPage.slug}}+tags:{{groupTag.slug}}"}}...{{/get}}
    {{/with-this}}
--}}
{{#with this}}{{> @partial-block}}{{/with}}
